-Where: §7 ("the item finders … read only the backlog, `active/` and `done/` folders, so a retired raft is never found"); the audit message that tells the user to retire R0040; Overrides; E2; `tests/lib/engine.luau` `engine.empty` (walks `""`, `active/`, `done/` only).
-Evidence: in `clone2`, R0040 was retired exactly as `recombine` does it (`git mv z-nile/.tracker/rafts/R0040 z-nile/.tracker/rafts/retired/R0040`, `retired: R0030`), then committed. `./zn audit` and `./zn lessons --check` stay clean, as E2 says. But `z-nile/check.sh --full` then **fails**, with 1049 passed and 3 failed:
