-Recommendation: choose one shape and list every promoted spec and test helper it changes, found by running the full gate on a copy of today's tree after `recombine R0030 R0040` (the reproduction above). Name each one in Overrides. Add a regression case to AC8 or to recombine.spec that runs those specs (c0114/classified, c0043/rounds, c0005/worktree) on a copy with a retired raft. Make `engine.empty` clear `retired/`, and add a case that fails when it doesn't. Mutant: `engine.empty` without `retired/`.
