-Where: `setStatus` guard ("<id> is in <R> on origin/main: z-raft takes it out of <R> before z-design claims it"); z-design §1; zz-rules **Rafting**; z-raft §4 ("`./zn recombine` it into a raft of its own, or start again without it"); zz-review raft mode.
