+### 12. Interfaces
+- **From c0114/c0120/c0115/c0116**: `./zn`, `z-nile/engine/`, `projects.at`/`roots`/`named`, the item folder `<root>/issues/<id>/`, `skills.INLINED`/`inlinedSkills`, the skill folders, `raft-plan --apply` in a rafting worktree (c0116 §11), the `raft:` lock, `release`.
